File name: DUE2LOOP.MP
Path description: Duegars, large loop.
Path starts: Duergar Lord.
Path ends: ---
Area of the game: Module 4
Level recommendation: 45+
Type of path: Loop
File format: New
Monsters encountered: duergar captain, duergar warrior, duergar lord.
Additional information:

When scripting this area solo, make these changes to MegaMud's monster
settings (under Game Data -> Monsters):

duergar captain: Friend.
duergar warrior: Enemy, non-hostile, normal priority.
duergar lord: Either 1) Friend (if you don't want to kill him), or
                     2) Enemy, last priority.

This way, when you attack a warrior, the captain in the room will take the
hits, and once your get past the captain, you will simply attack the warriors
as normal.

If you want to party script this area, see the Info section of MegaMud Online
for more information.

Cure poison is very useful for this area :)
